-- title:
--   Internal central products of subgroups
-- statement:
--   The internal two-factor central product of two subgroups $R_1,R_2\le G$, absent from Mathlib. It is used in BG §4 Theorem 4.16, case (2) (Blackburn), where a $p$-group $R$ of rank at most 2 is a central product $R=R_1\circ R_2$.
--
--   The main structure is `IsCentralProduct`, the internal central product of two subgroups.
--
--   The bundle also proves 3 supporting lemmas used by later statements.
